  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote: the grace of God has appeared, bringing salvation to all men, instructing us to live soberly, righteously, and godly in this present age, looking for the blessed hope and appearing of Jesus Christ. How do you live in the present age, looking for the appearing, when the grace has already shown its face once?"
